          "explanation": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>With $n = 4$: $\\sum x = 12$, $\\sum y = 288$, so $\\bar x = 3$, $\\bar y = 72$.<br/><br/>$\\sum x^2 = 4+4+9+25 = 42 \\Rightarrow S_{xx} = 42-\\dfrac{12^2}{4} = 42-36 = 6$<br/><br/>$\\sum y^2 = 961+1296+8836+16129 = 27222 \\Rightarrow S_{yy} = 27222-\\dfrac{288^2}{4} = 27222-20736 = 6486$<br/><br/>$\\sum xy = 2(31)+2(36)+3(94)+5(127) = 62+72+282+635 = 1051 \\Rightarrow S_{xy} = 1051-\\dfrac{12\\times 288}{4} = 1051-864 = 187$<br/><br/>$$r=\\frac{S_{xy}}{\\sqrt{S_{xx}S_{yy}}}=\\frac{187}{\\sqrt{6\\times 6486}}=\\frac{187}{\\sqrt{38916}}=\\frac{187}{197.271}=0.9479\\approx 0.948$$<br/>Strong positive linear relationship, as expected — taller trees have thicker bases.</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Với $n = 4$: $\\sum x = 12$, $\\sum y = 288$, nên $\\bar x = 3$, $\\bar y = 72$.<br/><br/>$\\sum x^2 = 4+4+9+25 = 42 \\Rightarrow S_{xx} = 42-\\dfrac{12^2}{4} = 42-36 = 6$<br/><br/>$\\sum y^2 = 961+1296+8836+16129 = 27222 \\Rightarrow S_{yy} = 27222-\\dfrac{288^2}{4} = 27222-20736 = 6486$<br/><br/>$\\sum xy = 2(31)+2(36)+3(94)+5(127) = 62+72+282+635 = 1051 \\Rightarrow S_{xy} = 1051-\\dfrac{12\\times 288}{4} = 1051-864 = 187$<br/><br/>$$r=\\frac{S_{xy}}{\\sqrt{S_{xx}S_{yy}}}=\\frac{187}{\\sqrt{6\\times 6486}}=\\frac{187}{\\sqrt{38916}}=\\frac{187}{197{,}271}=0{,}9479\\approx 0{,}948$$<br/>Quan hệ tuyến tính dương rất mạnh, đúng như kỳ vọng — cây càng cao thì gốc càng to.</p></div>"
